# Add Project Rule to Project Subfolder

Whenever the developer requests you to add a project rule:
1. Place the rule in the appropriate `project` subfolder (e.g., `.cursor/rules/always/project`).
2. If the `project` directory does not exist, create it before adding the rule.

## Example
If the user says "add a project rule - whenever I say ham in chat - reply with the phrase green eggs" then the rule should be created in `.cursor/rules/always/project`.


